      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>An immense grey-scaled serpent with two clawed forelimbs and a crown of obsidian horns. Her eyes glow like coals. Old scars cross her snout, and ash drifts from the vents along her neck. Her coils wrap around a lava-lit crag.</p>",
